    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the public authorities law, in relation to the village of Suffern parking authority and repealing title 18 of article 7 of such law relating thereto",
    "basePrintNo": "S6993",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S6993-2013",
    "coSponsors": {
